### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Transferencia P2P (cambia IDs; genera una key por pago y REUSALA en reintentos)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

{ "source_account_id": "<id-irma>", "dest_alias": "juan.mp", "amount": "1500.00", "currency": "ARS", "memo": "cena" }

### Saldo
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/accounts/<id-irma>/balance

### Historial
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/accounts/<id-irma>/transactions?limit=20
